### TaskFlow API — VS Code REST Client
### Install "REST Client" extension (humao.rest-client) to use this file
### Set @token after login

@baseUrl = http://localhost:5000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE
@projectId = YOUR_PROJECT_ID_HERE
@taskId = YOUR_TASK_ID_HERE


### ========================================
### AUTH
### ========================================

### Signup
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/signup
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

###

### Get Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Profile
PUT {{baseUrl}}/auth/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Smith"
}


### ========================================
### DASHBOARD
### ========================================

### Get Dashboard Stats
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Get My Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/dashboard/my-tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### PROJECTS
### ========================================

### List All Projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create Project
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Website Redesign",
  "description": "Complete overhaul of the company website",
  "due_date": "2025-06-30"
}

###

### Get Project
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Project
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Website Redesign v2",
  "status": "active"
}

###

### Delete Project
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### PROJECT MEMBERS
### ========================================

### Get Members
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add Member
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "jane@example.com",
  "role": "member"
}

###

### Remove Member (replace userId)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/members/USER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### TASKS
### ========================================

### List Tasks
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### List Tasks — Filter by status
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks?status=in_progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Create Task
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design new homepage layout",
  "description": "Create wireframes and high-fidelity mockups for the homepage redesign",
  "priority": "high",
  "status": "todo",
  "due_date": "2025-05-15"
}

###

### Get Task
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Update Task Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "in_progress"
}

###

### Update Task — Full
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Design new homepage layout",
  "priority": "critical",
  "status": "review",
  "due_date": "2025-05-10"
}

###

### Delete Task
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}


### ========================================
### COMMENTS
### ========================================

### Get Comments
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

###

### Add Comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{projectId}}/tasks/{{taskId}}/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "I've started working on this. Should be done by EOD."
}


### ========================================
### HEALTH
### ========================================

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:5000/health
